sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Browser
    participant Flask
    participant TenantDB
    participant MainDB

    Note over User,MainDB: Authentication Flow
    User->>Browser: Enter email + password
    Browser->>Flask: POST /auth/login
    Flask->>MainDB: Verify credentials, load org_id + db_name
    Flask-->>Browser: Set encrypted session cookie
    Browser-->>User: Redirect to Dashboard

    Note over User,MainDB: Creating a Sale Invoice
    User->>Browser: Click "New Sale"
    Browser->>Flask: GET /sales/new
    Flask->>TenantDB: Load customers, payment methods
    Flask-->>Browser: Render new sale form

    User->>Browser: Type product name in search box
    Browser->>Flask: GET /sales/search?q=product (HTMX)
    Flask->>TenantDB: SELECT products WHERE name ILIKE...
    Flask-->>Browser: Return product rows (partial HTML)

    User->>Browser: Select product, set quantity, submit
    Browser->>Flask: POST /sales/new (form data + CSRF token)
    Flask->>TenantDB: INSERT sale_invoices (trigger sets invoice_number)
    Flask->>TenantDB: INSERT sale_items
    Flask->>TenantDB: INSERT daily_ledger entry
    Flask-->>Browser: Redirect to invoice detail

    Note over User,MainDB: Downloading Invoice PDF
    User->>Browser: Click "Print Invoice"
    Browser->>Flask: GET /exports/sale-invoice/:id
    Flask->>TenantDB: Load invoice + items + shop settings
    Flask-->>Browser: Render PDF (xhtml2pdf, Bangla font)
